            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ngu Binh",
            "review_text": "Tram Huynh\nVietnam153 contributions\n0\nSuper secret restaurant in Saigon\nJan 2018 • Couples\nI accidently figure out this place when I traveled around. You need to book table before coming if you come in the evening. The place looks like any house and a bit old not like a restaurant. They have no place to park car, only for motorbike. Quick service and super clean place. They serve Hue foods. The foods are good but quite pricey. I dont think I will come back again.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2018",
